--TEST--
a call that resolved carries no diagnostic, so no fix is offered on it, only the refactoring that inlines the call, `rule:ide/a-code-action-ships-only-a-fix-a-diagnostic-already-knows`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User
{
    public function greet(): string
    {
        return "hi";
    }
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->gre<|>et();
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
11:6-11:17 refactor.inline Inline this call to `greet` -> ""hi""
